      "text": "$b+c-a=0$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because$ System of equations has more than one solution\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\Delta=\\Delta_{1}=\\Delta_{2}=\\Delta_{3}=0$ for infinite solution\r\n\r\n$\\begin{aligned}\r\n\r\n\\Delta_{1} &=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n\r\na & 2 & 3 \\\\\r\n\r\nb & -1 & 5 \\\\\r\n\r\nc & -3 & 2\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\\right|=a(13)+2(5 c-2 b)+3(-3 b+c) \\\\\r\n\r\n&=13 a-13 b+13 c=0\r\n\r\n\\end{aligned}$\r\n\r\ni.c, $a-b+c=0$\r\n\r\nor $\\quad b-c-a=0$",
    "image": null
  },
